    unit. Programmes and multi-phase programmes are governed by the respective quotation.
  </p>
  <p>
    These General Terms and Conditions are provided to the Client before or at the latest
    upon conclusion of the contract in a storable and printable version, or made accessible
    via a permanently available, storable link. They become a legally valid part of the
