    separate prior approval by the Client. Confidential content and personal data may not
    be used. Consent or approval once given may be revoked with effect for the future.
    Ebmeyer Consulting removes materials already published within a reasonable period. Use
    takes place in compliance with confidentiality and applicable data protection law.
  </p>
  <p>
    Where a special condition was expressly agreed in return for a reference or case study,
    the Client undertakes to provide the agreed reference or case study within 30 calendar
    days of completion of the services. Use of the reference or case study by Ebmeyer
    Consulting requires prior express consent or separate approval in accordance with this
